{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Night at the Lake</strong></i> is a first-person atmospheric psychological horror where you play as a guard working at a remote lake. Every evening, you patrol the area, fill out reports, and make sure no one stays behind after dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as night falls, strange and unsettling things begin to happen. You encounter eerie events, disturbing discoveries, and a growing feeling that someone \u2014 or something \u2014 is watching you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear but tense narrative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive atmosphere of solitude and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of the lakeside area and interaction with the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the unsettling quiet of the night, occasionally broken by something sinister.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3872610?t=1773115768","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3872610?t=1773115768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872610/19ff09982a210f2cd8f587a07821b5bbb0a3fb8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773115768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3872610/19ff09982a210f2cd8f587a07821b5bbb0a3fb8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773115768","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3956950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Night at the Lake</strong></i> is a first-person atm